; The boss arena keeps the floor's rule and drops its furniture. Four zones at the corners leave
; the centre cold, which inverts every combat room before it: the safe ground is now the middle of
; the arena, where the boss is. A player who has learned to fight from the edges of this floor has
; to unlearn it in the last room of it.
